{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"880","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"綠能產業放款 一年半增737億","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">2020/07/09 &nbsp;05:30</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%B6%A0%E8%83%BD%E6%94%BE%E6%AC%BE.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 75%;\\\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">截至今年5月底，國銀對綠能產業放款餘額1兆1680億元，相較2018年底新增737億元。（資料照）</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">〔記者王孟倫／台北報導〕金融業挺綠能！金管會昨公布，截至今年5月底，本國銀行對綠能產業放款餘額1兆1680億元，與2018年底的1兆0943億元相較，等於1年5個月新增737億元。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">金管會2017年11月擬定「綠色金融行動方案」，包括：授信、投資、資本市場籌資、人才培育、促進綠色金融商品或服務深化發展、資訊揭露、推廣綠色永續理念等7大面向，總計25項措施。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">金管會鼓勵國銀 發行綠色債券</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">金管會鼓勵國銀對綠能產業放款，並發行綠色債券籌資。根據金管會統計，國銀對綠能相關產業放款餘額，2018年底為1兆0943億元，2019年底1兆1631億元，2020年5月底增至1兆1680億元。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">金管會表示，新任主委黃天牧今年5月上任後宣布將繼續推出「綠色金融行動方案2.0」，期程約2年半，實施至2022年底。金管會近期已邀集相關局處討論，目前仍在彙整中，預計還會再找相關學者研商，8月底可望定案。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">金管會官員透露，「綠色金融行動方案2.0」將參考國內外專家的經驗及意見，一方面與國際接軌，另一方面強化精進國內的部分；此外，將鼓勵銀行業朝「赤道原則」、「責任銀行原則」、「責任投資原則」及「保險原則」努力。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源: https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/paper/1385206</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-07-09","clk_count":"51"}},"__N_SSG":true}